FluidX3D Studio: optional patch for FluidX3D (https://github.com/ProjectPhysX/FluidX3D)

Draws the skybox as the background of the visualisation instead of a flat
colour. Apply it inside the FluidX3D checkout, see README.md.

This patch contains and alters source code of FluidX3D, Copyright (c)
2022-2026 Dr. Moritz Lehmann. It is licensed under the FluidX3D license
(LICENSES/FluidX3D.md), not under the AGPL of FluidX3D Studio. A FluidX3D
built with it is an altered version and has to be marked as such.

